/**
 * The documentation sidebar.
 *
 * Lives here rather than inline in `astro.config.mjs` because two things need
 * it: Starlight, to render the sidebar, and the social-card endpoint, to label
 * each card with the group its page belongs to. One list, so a card can never
 * disagree with the navigation.
 *
 * Ordering is explicit rather than autogenerated, so a new page needs an entry
 * here as well as a file.
 */

